msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then, my sister fell in love with a moderately well-off aristocrat. ⟪k:1⟫Both my mom and I "
"were supportive of her and her desire to marry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Puis, ma sœur est tombée amoureuse d’un aristocrate assez aisé. ⟪k:1⟫Ma mère et moi, on l’a "
"encouragée à se marier."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64475190223cea41bb1ec850b0bed633590e3adc45f715a3a6b62202a8d69ae9
