msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But their union almost fell apart because she was “not suitable” for him. ⟪k:1⟫Merchants "
"were hardly the lowest class—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais leur union faillit être compromise car elle n’était pas⟪k:1⟫« convenable » pour lui. "
"⟪k:2⟫Les marchands ne faisaient pas partie de la classe populaire—"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
