msgid "⟪k:0⟫what we lacked, instead, was wealth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫non, ce qui nous manquait, c’était la richesse."

#: scenario5:scenario5_544B30C8_2862_43A1_8AF6_ABB4BC74ACEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
