msgid "⟪k:0⟫We needed another source of money, beyond what the shop took in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nous avions besoin d’une autre source d’argent, le magasin ne suffisait plus."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2950F572_63BF_42D2_90BD_943E614D3831
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
