msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce fut à ce moment-là qu’une personne de l’éminent domaine Bollinger m’approcha."

#: scenario5:scenario5_631D3376_1203_4553_AAA4_E3A30A8168E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b19f4f3fb36fb88a6af79ae57ccbc42ba6cf1e3158ecef6280455f4a6a37b104
