#: scenario5:scenario5_DAEFFD6E_3626_4EE1_8021_7799F467F2D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6865fe95b638baaf29b3b5a2163e22a589fbc7ee947b951e6a58d1d32369d271
